{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "or-copy-with-links-2026-11-25",
		"name": "OpenRegister Copy With Links",
		"description": "POST /api/objects/{register}/{schema}/{id}/copy, asserted over HTTP (change records-copy-with-links, task 1.3).\n\nWHAT IT ASSERTS: the refusals in the order the controller asks them (401 without a session, 404 for a missing source, 403 without create on the schema, 422 for an unknown link kind and for an upsert key); an override the schema refuses answers as the create path does and writes nothing (CONTROL: one module, the suite unchanged); a copy with relationRows and incoming answers 201 with a new uuid, the override, both rows and the suite reported copied; the copy carries both rows, the suite lists source and copy, and the source keeps its name and its own rows.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT ASSERT: files (a file copy needs a folder on disk; CopyFilesTest and ObjectsControllerCopyTest cover it) and a referrer the caller may not update (CopyObjectTest).\n\nHermetic: it creates its register, two schemas, objects and a second account, and removes all of them.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
